      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead intake\nThree ways in, one pipeline: site form webhook (POST /webhook/lead-intake), the hosted form (/form/request-a-quote), and the leads/inbound Gmail label (Claude pulls the lead out of the email). Junk filter, disposable-domain check, HubSpot upsert by email (dedupe), deal on new contacts only, Slack alert to #leads, every lead logged to the Lead log sheet. New leads kick off 'Project 1: Enrich lead' without waiting, so the rep is never held up by enrichment.",
        "color": 4
      }
